@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

POST {{baseUrl}}/ballot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pollingStationCode": "0002",
  "votes": [
    { "candidateNumber": 13, "count": 120 },
    { "candidateNumber": 22, "count": 100 }
  ]
}

### Consultar extrato
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/2/extrato

### Criar transação de crédito
POST {{baseUrl}}/clientes/2/transacoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 80000,
  "tipo": "c",
  "descricao": "salario"
}

### Criar transação de débito
POST {{baseUrl}}/clientes/2/transacoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 80000,
  "tipo": "d",
  "descricao": "mercado"
}

### Cliente inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/999/extrato